<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirm your email — ATLAS</title>
    <style>
        /* Inline email styles in the ATLAS palette (light surface system). */
        body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #F4F7F5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; }
        table { border-collapse: collapse; }
        .wrapper { width: 100%; background-color: #F4F7F5; padding: 32px 0; }
        .container { max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; background: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #DDE5E1; }
        .header { background: #0A0F0E; padding: 20px 28px; }
        .brand { color: #F5FAF8; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
        .brand i { color: #4CAF94; }
        .body { padding: 28px; color: #212D29; }
        h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #12221E; }
        p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #556B64; margin: 0 0 16px; }
        p strong { color: #212D29; }
        .btn { display: inline-block; background: #2F5D50; color: #FFFFFF !important; text-decoration: none;
               font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 10px; margin: 8px 0 16px; }
        .fallback { font-size: 12px; color: #8A9892; word-break: break-all; }
        .footer { padding: 16px 28px; background: #F4F7F5; font-size: 12px; color: #8A9892; text-align: center; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <table class="wrapper" role="presentation" width="100%">
        <tr><td align="center">
            <table class="container" role="presentation">
                <tr>
                    <td class="header">
                        <span class="brand">&#128196; ATLAS</span>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="body">
                        <h1>Confirm your email</h1>
                        <p>Welcome to <strong>ATLAS</strong>! Please confirm your email address to activate your account and start using the platform.</p>
                        <p style="text-align:center;">
                            <a href="{{ url }}" class="btn">Confirm my email</a>
                        </p>
                        <p class="fallback">If the button does not work, copy and paste this link into your browser:<br>{{ url }}</p>
                        <p style="font-size:12px;color:#8A9892;margin:0;">This link expires after 1 hour. If you did not register on ATLAS, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="footer">ATLAS — CV Platform &middot; sent automatically, please do not reply</td>
                </tr>
            </table>
        </td></tr>
    </table>
</body>
</html>
